  "_approach": "Kick-stutter build with a silence gap: bar 1 is straight 4/4 with a doubled 16th pair into beat 3; in bar 2 the kick stutters in 16ths (beats 1-2) then 32nds (beat 3) alongside a 32nd snare rush on beat 4 that peaks at 127 - then the final two 32nds are empty so the drop's downbeat lands on silence. Ref: sub-drop signposts on Armand Van Helden's 'Spin Spin Sugar' remix, modern revival edits (Bklava, Interplanetary Criminal). (re-voiced for the Vermona DRM1 MKIII's 8 channels)",
